Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: testchar.c
Line: 709
Function: testUserEncoding
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: xmlMalloc is not checked for failure; if it returns NULL, the immediate writes to buf (buf[k++] = ...) dereference a NULL pointer on OOM.

